{"title":"Accent Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAccent Artificial Christmas Trees – Small Christmas Trees for Every Space\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAccent artificial Christmas trees are crafted to bring festive warmth to every corner of your home. These compact Christmas trees are ideal for bedrooms, hallways, entryways, offices, or alongside a larger artificial Christmas tree, adding a cozy decorative touch without overwhelming your space.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you're looking for a \u003ca title=\"Tabletop Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/3-foot-artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003etabletop Christmas tree\u003c\/a\u003e, a mini Christmas tree, a small Christmas tree for tight spaces, or an accent tree to complement your full-size Christmas tree, these versatile designs make it easy to spread holiday cheer throughout your home.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy choose an accent artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAccent Christmas trees are ideal for adding personal festive detail to smaller spaces or enhancing your overall home décor. Their compact size makes them easy to place throughout your home, while still creating a warm and inviting holiday atmosphere.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat size are accent artificial Christmas trees?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAccent artificial Christmas trees are smaller than traditional trees, making them perfect for tabletops or slim spaces. These trees are created to fit comfortably in areas where a full-size tree might not work while still bringing Christmas style to your space. King of Christmas offers accent trees in sizes ranging from 3 feet up to 6.5 feet, making it easy to find the right fit for any room or surface. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhere should you place an accent Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003ePopular placements include secondary or children's bedrooms, console tables, side tables, nightstands, kitchen counters, mantels, and entryways.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eMany customers also use accent trees to complement their main \u003ca title=\"Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003eartificial Christmas tree\u003c\/a\u003e by creating a layered holiday display throughout the house.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat are the most popular accent Christmas trees?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eTwinkle LED twig trees have become one of the most popular accent Christmas tree styles because they create a striking visual statement in any space. These slender trees are often used in entryways, beside fireplaces, or displayed in pairs to frame a room with a soft holiday glow.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAt King of Christmas, our pre-lit twig-style accent trees are available in both green and flocked designs, offering versatile options to complement a range of holiday décor styles. One of the most popular options is the \u003ca title=\"Windsor Fir Tree\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/products\/4-windsor-tree-fir-led?variant=44827520205000\"\u003eWindsor Fir\u003c\/a\u003e, a pre-lit accent tree available in heights ranging from 4 to 5.5 feet. Featuring elegant twinkle LED lighting, the Windsor Fir and Windsor Flock can be styled on their own as a statement piece or grouped together to create a dramatic holiday display.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eHow do you decorate an accent Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAccent Christmas trees can be decorated in the same ways as a full-size Christmas tree, just on a smaller scale. Start with a strand of warm white lights if your tree is unlit, then layer in ornaments, small picks, and a ribbon bow at the top for a finished look. Some customers also place their accent tree inside a decorative pot or planter for an extra touch of style and personalization. \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you're decorating a small space or enhancing your holiday décor throughout your home, accent artificial Christmas trees offer a perfect balance of charm and versatility. Explore our collection to find the best small Christmas tree that brings warmth and festive style to every corner of your space.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"6' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 350 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642895921216,"sku":"PF-T6-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fbb2edf4-c5c9-4ad1-b201-ca0c1c1c4b0e.jpg?v=1714675465"},{"product_id":"3-foot-king-flock-tree-unlit","title":"3' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tabletop Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eJust admit it, we all know why you're here. You might have seen it at a friend's place, or perhaps your cousin won't quit it with how stunning theirs looks, or maybe you're checking in to see if all that Instagram hype is real. Well, without further ado, we present the 3' King Flock mini tree. With a natural-colored burlap base, the 3' King Flock tree is a scaled-down version of the king flock without compromising on the quality or details of the tree. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe King Flock Christmas tree is one of our premier signature trees. It features state of the art design with a blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) resulting in a grand and beautiful hallmark Christmas tree. With heavily flocked tips, you can enjoy the look of freshly fallen snow adorning each branch of your tree. So let it snow this holiday season while you sip eggnog, and marvel at this wonderland masterpiece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642907258944,"sku":"KF-T3-U","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFlock-2-2_170a15ef-d464-454d-9625-ca3ff991681f.jpg?v=1714673849"},{"product_id":"3-foot-king-flock-tree-led","title":"3' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tabletop Tree with 50 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eJust admit it, we all know why you're here. You might have seen it at a friend's place, or perhaps your cousin won't quit it with how stunning theirs looks, or maybe you're checking in to see if all that Instagram hype is real. Well, without further ado, we present the 3' King Flock mini tree. With a natural-colored burlap base, the 3' King Flock tree is a scaled-down version of the king flock without compromising on the quality or details of the tree. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe King Flock Christmas tree is one of our premier signature trees. It features state of the art design with a blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) resulting in a grand and beautiful hallmark Christmas tree. With heavily flocked tips, you can enjoy the look of freshly fallen snow adorning each branch of your tree. So let it snow this holiday season while you sip eggnog, and marvel at this wonderland masterpiece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642907979840,"sku":"KF-T3-L","price":74.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFlock-2-2_ac68b0d3-ee5d-45d8-a708-8a5b98f62f20.jpg?v=1714673856"},{"product_id":"6-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-unlit","title":"6' King Noble Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642909847616,"sku":"KNF-T6-U","price":199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-3_6ef8cc7c-2ec1-4b6c-bb8f-11a658704624.jpg?v=1718158207"},{"product_id":"6-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-led","title":"6' King Noble Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree with 450 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Green \/ LED","offer_id":28642909945920,"sku":"KNF-T6-L","price":429.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/King-Noble-Fir-v1_169f3774-d549-4ff3-a309-d3be5e3bcb60.png?v=1714672821"},{"product_id":"3-foot-royal-fir-unlit","title":"3' Royal Fir Tabletop Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhy settle for less this holiday season when you can celebrate in grand style. Add a breathtaking Christmas tree to your home decor when you choose the Royal Fir to grace your home this holiday season. This stunning and magnificent Christmas tree is full-bodied and features realistic foliage that creates a beautiful and lifelike display. The Royal Fir is one of our hallmark signature trees and features a high-end design for the ultimate Christmas tree display. The 3' Royal Fir is a miniature version of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/royal-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Fir Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e. Using the same tips and structure to give the tree a full-bodied and realistic look. The base is made of porcelain and resembles a wooden tree stump. Round out your Christmas collection this holiday season with the 3' Royal Fir tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":29445093883968,"sku":"RF-T3-U","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021RoyalFir-3-2.jpg?v=1718158123"},{"product_id":"6-5-pink-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' Duchess Pink Flock Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring a magical winter wonderland into your home with the one and only, Duchess Flock. This artfully designed masterpiece features vibrant colors and intricate details, creating a unique, unforgettable centerpiece that delights and inspires holiday memories for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Pink","offer_id":30106209878080,"sku":"PINKF-T6-5L","price":349.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Pink.Duchess.jpg?v=1718157841"},{"product_id":"6-5-blue-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' Duchess Blue Flock Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring a magical winter wonderland into your home with the one and only, Duchess Flock. This artfully designed masterpiece features vibrant colors and intricate details, creating a unique, unforgettable centerpiece that delights and inspires holiday memories for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Blue","offer_id":30106210041920,"sku":"BLUEF-T6-5L","price":359.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/BlueDuchess_bf0a3bb7-e06d-4c25-9ab5-6f5eeed9128e.jpg?v=1714666421"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' Yorkshire Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":37778112446664,"sku":"YFS-T6.5-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/YorkshireFirSlim.png?v=1722014899"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Yorkshire Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":37778112512200,"sku":"YFS-T7.5-U","price":199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/yorkshire-fir-slim_f6153517-d6e6-49b0-ab68-8944a7598609.jpg?v=1722014819"},{"product_id":"3-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"3' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tabletop Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eNo Christmas setting is complete without at least one tabletop tree! A scaled down version of our signature flock collection, the small but mighty Queen Flock mini Christmas tree sits perfectly on any tabletop, fireplace hearth, or anywhere else that needs a “little” Christmas spirit. 3 feet tall and 18” wide, this portable beauty can easily be moved around anywhere for quick and easy redecorating. Plus, with a blend of realistic and classic needle tips combined with handmade heavily flocked branches, you and your loved ones will get to enjoy the magical feeling of freshly fallen snow in the warmth of your own home\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284858908872,"sku":"QF-T3-U","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021QueenFlock-2-2_a4936b8b-b425-4e84-bc55-9ba70b26462d.jpg?v=1714674019"},{"product_id":"3-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"3' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tabletop Tree with 50 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eNo Christmas setting is complete without at least one tabletop tree! A scaled down version of our signature flock collection, the small but mighty Queen Flock mini Christmas tree sits perfectly on any tabletop, fireplace hearth, or anywhere else that needs a “little” Christmas spirit. 3 feet tall and 18” wide, this portable beauty can easily be moved around anywhere for quick and easy redecorating. Plus, with a blend of realistic and classic needle tips combined with handmade heavily flocked branches, you and your loved ones will get to enjoy the magical feeling of freshly fallen snow in the warmth of your own home. For added convenience, this elegant garland has been expertly pre-strung with 50 warm white LED lights, which are battery operated for a clean and seamless accent that won’t use up your outlets and can be placed virtually anywhere!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284858974408,"sku":"QF-T3-L","price":79.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021QueenFlock-2-2_7ecaac68-888e-40ee-9680-7f62ac4c4e1b.jpg?v=1714674017"},{"product_id":"7-foot-king-noble-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7' King Noble Flock Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Flock \/ Unlit","offer_id":41317601411272,"sku":"KNFL-T7-U","price":289.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingNobleFlock.jpg?v=1722887967"},{"product_id":"7-foot-king-noble-flock-tree-led","title":"7' King Noble Flock Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Flock \/ LED","offer_id":41317601476808,"sku":"KNFL-T7-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingNobleFlockLED.jpg?v=1723214176"},{"product_id":"3-foot-king-noble-fir-led","title":"3' King Noble Fir Tabletop Tree with 70 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen you need one elegant solution that offers the perfect upgrade for your holiday décor this season, look no further than the King Noble Tabletop Tree\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42314111680712,"sku":"KNF-T3-L-Bat","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KingNobleTabletop.jpg?v=1714673641"},{"product_id":"3-foot-royal-fir-led","title":"3' Royal Fir Tabletop Tree with 100 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhy settle for less this holiday season when you can celebrate in grand style. Add a breathtaking Christmas tree to your home decor when you choose the Royal Fir to grace your home this holiday season. This stunning and magnificent Christmas tree is full-bodied and features realistic foliage that creates a beautiful and lifelike display. The Royal Fir is one of our hallmark signature trees and features a high-end design for the ultimate Christmas tree display. The 3' Royal Fir is a miniature version of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/royal-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Fir Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e. Using the same tips and structure to give the tree a full-bodied and realistic look. The base is made of porcelain and resembles a wooden tree stump. Round out your Christmas collection this holiday season with the 3' Royal Fir tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42852912627912,"sku":"3F-RF-ST-L","price":119.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KOC2021RoyalFir-3-2_17a0b735-0403-4b0c-a7b7-36501dad0817.jpg?v=1718158120"},{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-pencil-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Pencil Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42854044139720,"sku":"PFP-T7-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrincePencilTreeLED.jpg?v=1786129938"},{"product_id":"4-windsor-tree-flock-led","title":"4' Windsor Flock Tree with 100 Warm White Twinkle LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serenity of freshly fallen snow indoors with our newest and most captivating addition yet, The Flocked Windsor Collection. This graceful accent tree adds a touch of wintry charm on its own or pairs beautifully with your centerpiece tree for a cohesive, magical display. A must-have for a cozy holiday atmosphere.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"4' \/ Flock","offer_id":44827518140616,"sku":"WNFL-T4-L","price":129.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Windsor_Main_Image.jpg?v=1765377801"},{"product_id":"4-windsor-tree-fir-led","title":"4' Windsor Fir Tree with 100 Warm White Twinkle LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring natural holiday charm to every corner of your home with our newest and most enchanting addition, The Windsor Collection. Designed with realistic foliage and graceful form, it shines as a beautiful accent to your main tree or a statement piece all its own. Effortless, classic, and full of Christmas spirit.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"4' \/ Green","offer_id":44827520205000,"sku":"WNFR-T4-L","price":129.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Windorfir.png?v=1786127497"},{"product_id":"4-5-windsor-tree-fir-led","title":"4.5' Windsor Fir Tree with 150 Warm White Twinkle LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring natural holiday charm to every corner of your home with our newest and most enchanting addition, The Windsor Collection. Designed with realistic foliage and graceful form, it shines as a beautiful accent to your main tree or a statement piece all its own. Effortless, classic, and full of Christmas spirit.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"4.5' \/ Green","offer_id":44828939518152,"sku":"WNFR-T4.5-L","price":159.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Windorfir.png?v=1786127497"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/angelascozyhome--jolly-elves--2022-11-20-01-20-06--instagram.jpg?v=1789054654","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/accent-artificial-christmas-trees.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}